# Line endings.
#
# This repository is edited on Windows and deployed into a Linux container, and
# CRLF in a shell script or Dockerfile is not a cosmetic problem: a backslash
# followed by CR+LF is not a line continuation, so `start.sh` fails to parse and
# every multi-line RUN in the Dockerfile breaks. That failure mode is easy to
# reintroduce by editing a file with the wrong tool, so it is pinned here rather
# than left to each contributor's editor settings.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh       text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf

# Binary, never translated.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.webm binary
*.exe  binary
*.zip  binary
